@about
new-page: true

= About this project

*The Last Majles* is planned as a long-form, single-player historical
simulation. It is inspired by the institutional density of *Social Democracy:
An Alternate History*, but it requires a distinct model of Iranian political
life rather than a reskin of a European parliamentary party system.

The design document in the repository states the historical thesis, system
requirements, content plan, standards of evidence, and bibliography.

